      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is a relief to finally admit that the \"fix\" is just a performance, and the wreckage doesn't have to be patched up anymore. The strength you lost was never yours to carry, and it is okay to stop pretending the old version is still there. Your current reality is the only truth that matters, and it is time to let go of the ghost instead of trying to resurrect it.",
